sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as trainer-operator<br/>controller-manager
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>(local)
    participant OSApi as OpenShift APIServer<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant JobSet as JobSet Operator
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>openshift-monitoring

    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
    Note over Admin,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Trainer CR Reconciliation
    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create Trainer CR (default-trainer)
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event (Trainer CR)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Check JobSet Operator installed<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: JobSetOperator CR status
    Operator->>OSApi: Read cluster TLS profile<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OSApi-->>Operator: TLS cipher suites + protocol versions
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Ensure namespace exists<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Read odh-trainer-config ConfigMap<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Platform version info
    Operator->>Kustomize: Render RHOAI overlay<br/>(apply RELATED_IMAGE overrides)
    Kustomize-->>Operator: Rendered manifests
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply<br/>(field owner: trainer-module-controller)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Applied resources
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Status check + GC stale resources
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
    Note over Prometheus,Operator: Flow 2: Metrics Scraping
    Prometheus->>Operator: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer token + RBAC
    Operator-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics
    end
